OL,3,GNEWSAHistory of children's photos
OL,4,Arevealed at gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe history of photographs taken by
OL,7,Fchildren has been revealed at a new
OL,8,Fexhibition.
OL,10,FUniversity of Brighton researcher
OL,11,FAnnebella Pollen curated Snap Happy!,
OL,12,Fwhich opens at The Photographers'
OL,13,FGallery in London on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe show and an accompanying book were
OL,16,Finformed by the visual and material
OL,17,Fculture professor's four-year study of
OL,18,Fchildren's photographs over the
OL,19,Fgenerations.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
