OL,3,GNEWSAHistory of children's photos
OL,4,Arevealed at gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They may seem inconsequential, they
OL,7,Fmay seem juvenile, foolish, amateurish,
OL,8,Fbut I wanted to look at them closely
OL,9,Fand to take them seriously," Pollen
OL,10,Ftold the BBC.
